---
status: published
title: The kitchen radio
date: 2026-10-01
author: June Okafor
excerpt: My grandmother's radio only got one station. That turned out to be enough.
image: https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582079768381-0e81b88db423?w=1600&q=80
imageAlt: A woman reading at a cafe table in low light
---

It was tuned to the shipping forecast so long the dial rusted in place.

I've been thinking about what we lose when we can choose everything.
